{"data": [{"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-22T03:02:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113103755352981506"], "id": "2113103755352981506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 716, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【10.22开盘速报】3700点开盘即破！三大指数低开低走，创业板半场重挫3.21%，全市场一度4500家下跌\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113103755352981506"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:53:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113478957735858478"], "id": "2113478957735858478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 770, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们早盘速报：三大指数集体低开下探，沪指午收跌1.2%失守3650，创业板9连跌，但300ETF放量托底、机器人独苗逆势封板\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113478957735858478"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113167069466308608"]}, "author_id": "186664270", "created_at": "2026-10-22T07:14:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113167071802429527"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QyTUDFdEYo", "end": 197, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/btcbigd/status/2113167071802429527/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113167069466308608", "start": 174, "url": "https://t.co/QyTUDFdEYo"}]}, "id": "2113167071802429527", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突发：中国股市正式进入熊市！\n\n【收盘数（10 月 22 日）】\n- 沪深 300 收 4,036，当天 −1.8%，距 6 月 22 日高点 5,060 跌了 20.2%，按跌 20% 的惯例算进熊\n- 上证综指距 5 月高点 −13.8%，还没到\n- 深证成指 −30.6%，创业板指 −41.1%，科创 50 −40.9%，这几个早就过线了 https://t.co/QyTUDFdEYo", "url": "https://x.com/btcbigd/status/2113167071802429527"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-22T06:01:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113148727770918979"], "id": "2113148727770918979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1648, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "尾盘多只宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113148727770918979"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-22T07:07:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113165451702485466"], "id": "2113165451702485466", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 6046, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "注意到了吗？昨天收盘后上交所召开首批主动 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113165451702485466"}, {"author_id": "2062811475446779905", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:24:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113577181452677207"], "id": "2113577181452677207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 10.23 复盘｜早盘失守 3600，午后 V 转收 3690，两市放量到 1.96 万亿，4526 家上涨。群里怕是又牛来速回了吧哈哈哈哈\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 19,563 亿，比昨天多 4,276 亿（+28%）。站上了 1.8 万亿门槛，而且是放量上涨，跟昨天的放量下跌性质完全不同。\n多只宽基 ETF", "url": "https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2113577181452677207"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113478470072487936"]}, "author_id": "829980811", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:54:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113479182386962737"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/N8U7em1pd1", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/shenrenlaile66/status/2113479182386962737/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113478470072487936", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/N8U7em1pd1"}]}, "id": "2113479182386962737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "截至午盘收盘上证下跌-1.2%，抵达3614.12，最低抵达3574.27，原因如下：\n三重压力共振导致普跌外部冲击：美债10Y收益率高位维持5%以上，压制全球高估值成长股估值地缘风险推升油价突破111美元，强化通胀担忧和加息预期亚太科技股联动下跌，日韩半导体龙头领跌，直接拖累A股AI硬件链 https://t.co/N8U7em1pd1", "url": "https://x.com/shenrenlaile66/status/2113479182386962737"}, {"author_id": "1978744913803227136", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113476074952953947"], "id": "2113476074952953947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "救市啦！", "url": "https://x.com/jixyStar/status/2113476074952953947"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-10-22T01:34:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113081424970653826"], "id": "2113081424970653826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 896, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们早，盘前瞻送上。\n\n先说隔夜外围，一句话：美股在回血，中概在挨打。", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113081424970653826"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113495432861306880"]}, "author_id": "1989322594286522368", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:59:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113495463710302554"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/F76VAGQmms", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CiaraJerem37771/status/2113495463710302554/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113495432861306880", "start": 178, "url": "https://t.co/F76VAGQmms"}]}, "id": "2113495463710302554", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "仅半个交易日，股票型ETF成交额超1248亿元，昨日全天为1888亿元，宽基型ETF成交额突破785亿元，昨日全天为1226亿。其中创业板ETF易方达（159915）成交额95亿、沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞（510300）成交额89亿、科创50ETF华夏（588000）成交额72亿。中证1000ETF南方（512100）成交额逼近昨日全天成交额，沪深30 https://t.co/F76VAGQmms", "url": "https://x.com/CiaraJerem37771/status/2113495463710302554"}, {"author_id": "2062811475446779905", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:44:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113235019007172833"], "id": "2113235019007172833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 10.22 复盘｜放量下杀，上证跌穿 3700 收 3658，535 家上涨，光模块龙头带头砍，疯了疯了还扛得住嘛\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 15,287 亿，比昨天多 994 亿（+6.95%）。但这是放量下跌：钱是在卖的时候放出来的，不是抢筹。离 1.8 万亿门槛还差 2,700 亿左右，量能这一关依然没过。\n\n【点位】\n上证收", "url": "https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2113235019007172833"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113622309865213953"]}, "author_id": "154574316", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:23:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113622316810977579"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y9UnGo1TPF", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2113622316810977579/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113622309865213953", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/Y9UnGo1TPF"}]}, "id": "2113622316810977579", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1682, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "10月23日，创业板ETF易方达成交197亿元，为上市以来历史第三高，仅次于2024年10月8日和9日；\n\n沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞、科创50ETF华夏成交额均超过150亿元。 https://t.co/Y9UnGo1TPF", "url": "https://x.com/9andrey9/status/2113622316810977579"}, {"author_id": "823178495253762048", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:08:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113256295553999174"], "id": "2113256295553999174", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1511, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股收盘复盘：跨资产定价分化与资金高低切观察\n\n今日A股市场呈现显著的结构性分化与资金再平衡特征。全市场超4990只个股下行，创业板指 收跌4.37%，两市总成交额放大至1.54万亿。  一、宏观定价与汇率锚点", "url": "https://x.com/Abijithpa3/status/2113256295553999174"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:37:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113520102348050729"], "id": "2113520102348050729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 49, "impression_count": 24184, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "这是护盘，但手法和十月上半月不一样。此前10月上半月出现的几次护盘操作，大多是直接瞄准几只市值最高的头部权重蓝筹个股拉抬指数，覆盖的标的范围非常窄，市场感知度并不高，这次直接从ETF产品端入手，操作路径和覆盖范围都和之前有明显区别。创业板ETF", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113520102348050729"}, {"author_id": "1579345963973365763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113427686064308695"], "id": "2113427686064308695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 241, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "昨日A股市场尾盘，宽基ETF异动。\n\n昨日，上证指数在3700点附近徘徊多日后，再次失守。最低到达3649点，月内第二次创下一年内新低。 ETF市场再次出现尾盘异动情况。多只宽基ETF成交额骤然放量。沪深300", "url": "https://x.com/lili103103/status/2113427686064308695"}, {"author_id": "2096056678022311936", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:43:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113068761154777380"], "id": "2113068761154777380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 331, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "周四即将开盘，此时根本睡不着了，市场迎来重磅利好，今天将直接放量、又出大阳线？来不及解释了，直接上重点。", "url": "https://x.com/Q9925912/status/2113068761154777380"}, {"author_id": "575160853", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:56:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113132334509932557"], "id": "2113132334509932557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 344, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最近为什么大跌：\n不是估值贵，是没人接了\n盘面（10月21日收盘）：沪指 −0.6% 报 3713点（险守3700）、深成指 −0.82%、创业板指 −1.62% 报 2694点（盘中破2700，创去年8月新低）。成交额只有 1.44万亿，已经连续15个交易日没超过2万亿。3364只股票下跌。\n① 根本原因：内部流动性负反馈", "url": "https://x.com/success_cw/status/2113132334509932557"}, {"author_id": "2107614698233344001", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:47:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113537712170881295"], "id": "2113537712170881295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 392, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10.23 A股 午盘分析\n\n果然A股集体反弹，今天可以说是绝处逢生，成交额放量4300多亿，有资金开始入场了，短期可以喘口气了，接下来主要说几点：\n\n1、今天A股为何能够绝处逢生？以下这些数据成为关键：\n\n（1）一是两市放量4310亿元，今天可以说是放量探底回升，明显的放量是缓解当前流动性危机的关键；", "url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113537712170881295"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113485326442528768"]}, "author_id": "2107614698233344001", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:19:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113485333296009704"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sKUQhF3S7G", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113485333296009704/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113485326442528768", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/sKUQhF3S7G"}]}, "id": "2113485333296009704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 361, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "10.23 A股 早盘分析及下午看法\n\n一边杀科技，一边拉金融和消费，今天这是要开始保指数了！今天指数收出下影线的概率较高，但要看会有多少资金跟风进场，主要说几点：\n\n1、为什么说今天A股指数收出下影线的可能性较大？\n\n一是从开盘一小时来看，沪深300ETF的放量已经超越了昨天全天。 https://t.co/sKUQhF3S7G", "url": "https://x.com/Savingrko/status/2113485333296009704"}, {"author_id": "1913965111045398528", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:08:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113090201740624317"], "id": "2113090201740624317", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 697, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "三季报窗口里，钱在往两头躲。", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113090201740624317"}, {"author_id": "1945999632200265728", "created_at": "2026-10-22T06:14:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113152050888622433"], "id": "2113152050888622433", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "可以明确看出典型的“托盘护指”特征，但不能简单等同于“国家队全面进场救市”，它更多是“政策性资金护盘稳节奏”与“市场避险资金抱团”的共同作用。\n\n一、 为什么盘面具有很强的“护盘”信号？\n指数与超级权重的极端背离：左下角显示上证指数明显下挫", "url": "https://x.com/aixparty/status/2113152050888622433"}, {"author_id": "1514068351466713092", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:38:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113233624913088621"], "id": "2113233624913088621", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 10749, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 创业板今天这根“惊天大阴线”，绝对不是散户砸出来的！\n\n内幕资金到底在筹划什么？这几个细节细思极恐：\n\n诡异的时间点：上午盘面还在护盘，午后突然出现多股无厘头跳水，精准狙击关键支撑位。这绝非简单的获利盘回吐，而是算法交易和量化巨头提前收到的“神秘密令”！", "url": "https://x.com/yonghewang1969/status/2113233624913088621"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113251132000624640"]}, "author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-22T13:46:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113251643718357260", "2113265793244725359"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/z1cdgdqGiD", "end": 172, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113265793244725359/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113251132000624640", "start": 149, "url": "https://t.co/z1cdgdqGiD"}]}, "id": "2113265793244725359", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1555, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全球银行巨无霸，中国工商银行股价要创出历史新高了！\n\n创业板暴跌4.37%，工行创历史新高。同一个A股，两个平行世界。\n\n今天全市场近5000只个股飘绿，创业板指跌破2600点，从7月到现在跌了超40%。\n\n但工商银行盘中涨超2%，股价再创历史新高，A+H总市值重回A股“一哥”。\n\n这是为什么？ https://t.co/z1cdgdqGiD", "url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113265793244725359"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113648241501786112"]}, "author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:13:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113649911652585976"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cDH1G2Avq8", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113649911652585976/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113648241501786112", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/cDH1G2Avq8"}]}, "id": "2113649911652585976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1113, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🔥今天A股的深V反转，到底是请君入瓮，还是真正反转？\n\n我看到有小伙伴说：“今天A股下午爆拉3.49%，就为了骗你进场，这镰刀都抡冒烟了！ 太绝了！大A的套路真是万年不变。”\n\n因为他看到8小时前的大盘净流出 162.5亿元，而我看到同花顺的现在大盘数据显示：净流出 25.37亿元。 https://t.co/cDH1G2Avq8", "url": "https://x.com/Dragonhau66/status/2113649911652585976"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113251132000624640"]}, "author_id": "1321270432385896448", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:50:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113251643718357260", "211326579